     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts FRMedicationLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"FRMedicationLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"hcFRMedicationLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-medication</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-cda-produit-de-sante</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAProduitDeSante</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.identifyingCode[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAProduitDeSante.manufacturedProduct.manufacturedMaterial.code</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.classification</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAProduitDeSante.pharm:asSpecializedKind</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.productName</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAProduitDeSante.manufacturedProduct.manufacturedMaterial.name</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.marketingAuthorisationHolder</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.doseForm</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAProduitDeSante.manufacturedProduct.manufacturedMaterial.pharm:formCode</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.ingredient.isActive</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.ingredient.substance</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAProduitDeSante.pharm:ingredient.pharm:ingredient.pharm:code</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.ingredient.strengthInfo.strength</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAProduitDeSante.pharm:ingredient.pharm:quantity</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.ingredient.strengthInfo.basisOfStrengthSubstance</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.unitOfPresentation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>FRCDAProduitDeSante.pharm:asContent</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.containedQuantity</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>FRCDAProduitDeSante.pharm:asContent</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.amount</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAProduitDeSante.pharm:asContent</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.item.packageType</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAProduitDeSante.pharm:asContent.pharm:containerPackagedMedicine</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.device</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMMedication.characteristic</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efef